# gameengine-ai-tools (Debugger/AITools) config -- see Debugger/AITools/README.md
# "Core (MCPサーバー)" for what each key does.

# Debugger/AITools is this MCP tool's own checked-out submodule source,
# not this project's DirectX12 study code -- indexing it (~300 C++ files)
